From: smarty-fleet-write[bot] <333979660+smarty-fleet-write[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] run a caller hook in the pty child before exec

Herdr resets each pane child to SCHED_OTHER and the configured nice value
before exec, so a server at idle CPU priority does not pass it to panes.
The hook runs after setsid and TIOCSCTTY and before inherited descriptors
are closed; it cannot fail the spawn.

Issue: https://github.com/Smarty-Pants-Inc/smarty-dev/issues/11237
Upstream discussion: none
Upstream PR: none
Vendored base: portable-pty 0.9.0
